Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Proficiency level!

3
00:00:13.873 --> 00:00:18.392
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:18.442 --> 00:00:23.715
Today we learn: Neuroscience and Consciousness. Let's go!

5
00:00:24.431 --> 00:00:28.764
Neuroscience. Say it with me. Neuroscience!

6
00:00:32.261 --> 00:00:36.361
Consciousness. Say it with me. Consciousness!

7
00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:44.343
Neural correlate. Say it with me. Neural correlate!

8
00:00:47.862 --> 00:00:53.062
Cognitive process. Say it with me. Cognitive process!

9
00:00:56.564 --> 00:01:01.980
Subjective experience. Say it with me. Subjective experience!

10
00:01:05.443 --> 00:01:10.243
Brain plasticity. Say it with me. Brain plasticity!

11
00:01:13.744 --> 00:01:17.827
Perception. Say it with me. Perception!

12
00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:25.633
Sentience. Say it with me. Sentience!

13
00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:41.858
Grammar time! Academic qualifying language. Listen. This phenomenon remains, to some extent, unexplained by current neuroscience.

14
00:01:41.908 --> 00:01:50.231
Your turn. Say it with me. This phenomenon remains, to some extent, unexplained by current neuroscience.

15
00:01:54.960 --> 00:02:11.668
Neuroscience continues to explore the elusive nature of consciousness, searching for the neural correlates behind subjective experience. Understanding cognitive process and brain plasticity offers clues, yet true sentience and perception remain deeply mysterious.

16
00:02:11.718 --> 00:02:13.168
I like this story!

17
00:02:14.253 --> 00:02:19.530
Look! What's the word?

18
00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:21.102
Neural correlate!

19
00:02:22.203 --> 00:02:27.230
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:28.430
Perception!

21
00:02:29.611 --> 00:02:40.168
Think and answer. Do you think consciousness can ever be fully explained by neuroscience alone?

22
00:02:40.218 --> 00:02:41.375
Great answer!

23
00:02:42.414 --> 00:02:45.885
This unit's value is Intellectual Humility.

24
00:02:45.935 --> 00:02:49.083
I can show intellectual humility every day!

25
00:02:49.812 --> 00:02:54.359
Great work today! See you next time. Goodbye!

26
